# Build context for runner/Dockerfile is the repo root (it compiles the
# pillbox binary in-image). Keep the context small: only Cargo.* + src/ are
# COPYed, but excluding the heavy/irrelevant dirs speeds the context upload
# and avoids cache busting on unrelated churn.
target/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
runner/
.claude/
*.md
.env*
